sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as Origen (account-service / credit-service)
    participant R as MovementController
    participant U as RecordMovementUseCase
    participant P as MovementPersistencePort
    participant A as MovementMongoAdapter
    participant M as MongoDB

    O->>R: POST /api/v1/movements
    Note over R: body {productId, productType, movementType, amount}
    R->>U: execute(movement)
    U->>P: save(movement)
    P->>A: toDocument(movement)
    A->>M: save
    M-->>A: document
    A-->>P: document
    P-->>U: Movement
    U-->>R: Movement
    R-->>O: 201 Created
